 have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1743.45,"y":570.37,"cell":4624,"i":72,"name":"Reacury Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡝᢋᢑᢡᡆᢓᢛᢥᡝᠡᢡᢡᢟᡴᢐᡁᠵᢢᠱᢏᠼᡀᢓᢂᢡᡀᡗᠾᡴᢜᢟᠭᡟ᠐ᡍᠻᡝᠯᠱᠻᡁᢢᡍᠰ᠐ᡎᠯᢡᠱᡯᡏᡆᡒᠨᢑᡴ᠀ᠿᡑᢟᢡᠱᡟᡖ᠒᠀ᢋᡯᡐᡞᠧᡴᠧᢠᡗᠪᡖᡒᡆᢋᡍᠦᠰᡀᢡᡱᢞᡳᡏᠯᢁ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1737.39,"y":836.48,"cell":6055,"i":73,"name":"Cleokewes Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc29\ud802\ud802𐠂\udc24\ud802𐠃\udc33\udc14\ud802𐠅\ud802𐠑\ud802 \udc2e\udc2a\udc3f\ud802𐠅 \udc02\udc25\ud802 \udc12\udc3c\udc14\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \ud802\ud802𐠷𐠠𐠗\udc2f\udc04\ud802𐠜\udc1f𐠛𐠑\udc17\ud802𐠵\ud802𐠈𐠫\udc2c \udc11𐠿\udc30𐠤\udc24𐠧\udc3c𐠛\udc13\ud802𐠃𐠔 \udc2c</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":866.42,"y":1067.67,"cell":8008,"i":74,"name":"Stamsberg Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠡᡏᡡᡓ᠀ᡁᡙᡮᢞᢁᠿᢤᡔᡯᠭᡆᠨᡟᡳᢥᠩᡙᠧᡏ᠐ᢦᢒᡯᢠᢦᠪᠨᢦᢠᠵᡒᠩ᠒ᢓᡎᢜᠼᢤᠦᡁᠭᠳᡀᡲᡴᡆᠵᠨᡯᡓᠵᠳᢡᡎᡍᠾᠨ᠑ᢑᠼᡏᠠᡱᢀᡙᡠᡝᡑ᠀ᠠᡴᡕᢋᢓᠯᡗᡳᢑᡞᡔᡔᢋᠦᠠᠿᠵᢂ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1520.62,"y":313.91,"cell":3199,"i":75,"name":"Ruined City","note":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1502.45,"y":247.24,"cell":2679,"i":76,"name":"Ruined Stronghold","note":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":870.61,"y":938.28,"cell":6852,"i":77,"name":"Ruined Sacred site","note":"Ruins of an ancient sacred site. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":994.8,"y":901.48,"cell":6494,"i":78,"name":"Ruined Mausoleum","note":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":618.16,"y":318.29,"cell":3271,"i":79,"name":"Ruined Outpost","note":"Ruins of an ancient outpost. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4da","type":"libraries","x":834.5,"y":1031.3,"cell":7709,"i":80,"name":"Bifting Library","note":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":1817.14,"y":253.32,"cell":2704,"i":81,"name":"Travelling Breathtaking Circus","note":"Roll up, roll up, this breathtaking circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":574.28,"y":183.26,"cell":1859,"i":82,"name":"Travelling Wondrous Circus","note":"Roll up, roll up, this wondrous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":234.82,"y":237.29,"cell":2446,"i":83,"name":"Travelling Wondrous Circus","note":"Roll up, roll up, this wondrous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f93a","type":"jousts","dx":48,"x":927.82,"y":981.85,"cell":7297,"i":84,"name":"Hoyavikka Melee","note":"Warriors from around the land gather for a melee of might in Hoyavikka, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3a0","type":"fairs","x":1000.98,"y":875.17,"cell":6242,"i":85,"name":"Findur Fair","note":"A fair is being held in Findur, offering local wood, vinegar, and preserved food alongside foreign goods and services."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6f6","type":"canoes","x":120.06,"y":750.38,"cell":5503,"i":86,"name":"Minor Jetty","note":"A small location along the Lel-Zed Sena River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"icon":"glyph-1f417","type":"migration","x":126.75,"y":212.22,"cell":2121,"i":87,"name":"Scorpions migration","note":"A huge group of scorpions are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"icon":"glyph-1f483-1f3fd","type":"dances","x":1365.23,"y":67.17,"cell":688,"i":88,"name":"Bazimorka celebration","note":"A celebration has been organised at Bazimorka as a chance to gather the great and the good of the area together to be merry, make alliances and scheme around the crisis."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4a6","type":"mirage","x":339.58,"y":15.74,"cell":157,"i":89,"name":"Peculiar mirage","note":"This peculiar mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4a6","type":"mirage","x":1393.86,"y":111.02,"cell":1160,"i":90,"name":"Illusory mirage","note":"This illusory mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":1077.46,"y":1063.15,"cell":7931,"i":91,"name":"Ogurkogar Cavern","note":"The Ogurkogar Cavern. Locals claim that it is endlessly deep and unexplored."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":193.52,"y":9.85,"cell":12,"i":92,"name":"Mahrnemejashi Fracture","note":"The Mahrnemejashi Fracture. Locals claim that it is completely flooded."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":1638.14,"y":224.92,"cell":2398,"i":93,"name":"Molyemyans Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":485.1,"y":882.09,"cell":6341,"i":94,"name":"Brat Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":1845.14,"y":894.64,"cell":6535,"i":95,"name":"Witonwich Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":1811.79,"y":782.93,"cell":5713,"i":96,"name":"Westcke Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals",