s","px":14,"x":73.87,"y":971.66,"cell":6930,"i":105,"name":"Zach Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":1638.19,"y":769.9,"cell":5615,"i":106,"name":"Fumivo Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f386","type":"rifts","x":157.48,"y":18.86,"cell":144,"i":107,"name":"Cosmic Rift","note":"A rumoured cosmic rift in this area is causing cracks in reality itself to form."},{"icon":"glyph-1f480","type":"disturbed-burials","x":458.7,"y":88.7,"cell":758,"i":108,"name":"Disturbed Burial","note":"A burial site has been disturbed in this area, causing the dead to rise and attack the living."},{"icon":"glyph-1f480","type":"disturbed-burials","x":1743.52,"y":639,"cell":5008,"i":109,"name":"Disturbed Burial","note":"A burial site has been disturbed in this area, causing the dead to rise and attack the living."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1450.45,"y":198.14,"cell":2075,"i":110,"name":"Theoddam Tomb","note":"A desolate necropolis where an eerie stillness reigns. Time seems frozen amidst the decaying mausoleums, and the silence is broken only by the whispers of the wind and the rustle of tattered banners."},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":1579.84,"y":377.93,"cell":3685,"i":111,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/3685\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":1878.95,"y":507.55,"cell":4345,"i":112,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/4345\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow